#. module: pao_sales_commission_management
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:pao_sales_commission_management.field_comisionpromotores_promotor__promotor_type
msgid ""
"Determine the business rule used to calculate and release commission payments:\n"
"- External / Internal Salesperson: paid once the quote is fully invoiced and paid.\n"
"- Coordinator: in addition to the above, it must be verified that the contracted service has been performed (related purchase order)."
msgstr ""
"Determina la regla de negocio utilizada para calcular y liberar los pagos de comisiones:\n"
"- Vendedor externo/interno: se paga una vez que el presupuesto ha sido totalmente facturado y cobrado.\n"
"- Coordinador: además de lo anterior, debe verificarse que el servicio contratado se haya prestado (orden de compra asociada)."

